Chicago on its Data Portal under its Terms of Use:

  - Chicago Energy Benchmarking (xq83-jr8c)
  - Chicago Energy Benchmarking - Covered Buildings (g5i5-yz37)
  - Boundaries - Community Areas (igwz-8jzy)
